{"id":"n34895-1-2","stage":3,"title":"귀하 · 敬启","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34895-1-2-1","ko":"누구 앞으로 소포가 왔니?","zh":"有包裹寄到谁那里了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누구","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"表示“收，致”之意。","explanation":"앞：表示“收，致”之意。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"8","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞으로","audio":"/audio/cb4897c6b6949e02da6d.mp3"}},{"text":"소포가","meaning":"包裹","explanation":"소포：包裹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소포","audio":"/audio/2e59de152924fbbdd56c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49257","senseId":"1","lemma":"소포","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소포가","audio":"/audio/d0275847b312355fabf7.mp3"}},{"text":"왔니?","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔니","audio":"/audio/fcfe3eb77392c7ddf554.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"谁","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"表示“收，致”之意。","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"表示“收，致”之意。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"2e59de152924fbbd","term":"소포","zh":"包裹","audio":"/audio/2e59de152924fbbdd56c.mp3","entryId":"49257","definition":"通过邮局发送的、包装好的小行李。","pronunciation":["소ː포"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0851bcd2bd3ccae5cbd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n34895-1-2-2","ko":"‘강유민 귀하’라고 쓰여 있는 걸 보니 누나 건가 봐요.","zh":"上面写着‘姜裕敏女士’，应该是姐姐的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"‘강유민","meaning":"姜（姓氏）；裕敏","explanation":"강：姜（姓氏）；유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"강유민","audio":"/audio/cee05873d59ff4957e42.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강유민","audio":"/audio/cee05873d59ff4957e42.mp3"}},{"text":"귀하’라고","meaning":"敬启","explanation":"귀하：敬启；라고：标明直接引用的内容或名称：“写着、称为、说……”。","readings":[{"term":"귀하","audio":"/audio/2099cd7f323c38ac89f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34895","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀하’라고","audio":"/audio/307e49199db3f651b195.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰여","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰이다：写；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쓰이다","audio":"/audio/9363ab689aedbd77ccf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66568","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰여","audio":"/audio/9235acb84de63e0647ef.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf